Note on bundled third-party material:
- Terrain data derived from NASA SRTM (public domain), tiled by AWS Terrain Tiles.
- Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) and ECharts (Apache-2.0) are loaded from CDN, not vendored.
- The original POSSIM 3.0 C# sources and the Fortran physics DLL
  (storm_surge_physics.dll) are NOT distributed with this repository.
  Frame images under docs/data/build/** flagged as "fortran" were produced
  offline by that kernel and are included for demonstration only.
